# $crate_package_name Python package

UniFFI-generated Python package for the [`$crate_package_name`](../../../crates/$crate_package_name) JSON canonicalization primitive.

Generate the package from the repo root:

```bash
just generate-python-bindings $crate_package_name
```

The generated module exposes `canonicalize_json(json: str) -> bytes`, returning RFC 8785 canonical UTF-8 bytes for a JSON document.

`setup.py` marks the distribution as binary so wheel builds are platform-tagged instead of `py3-none-any`.
